WEBVTT

00:00:01.315 --> 00:00:13.159
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:18.899
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:25.805
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:37.342
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.551 --> 00:00:43.490
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:50.896
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:58.661
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.705 --> 00:01:05.579
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.579 --> 00:01:11.142
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:17.424
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.424 --> 00:01:25.889
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:51.425 --> 00:01:54.155
Look! Someone has
descended from the ship!

00:01:54.661 --> 00:01:56.096
I-Isn't that Demian?!

00:01:56.096 --> 00:01:58.223
W-What did you say?!

00:02:05.672 --> 00:02:06.807
Dumas!

00:02:06.807 --> 00:02:09.071
Oh, no! He's holding Helga!

00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:10.444
Helga?

00:02:10.444 --> 00:02:12.512
She's the reincarnation
of Princess Tina.

00:02:12.512 --> 00:02:14.114
Princess Tina.

00:02:14.114 --> 00:02:15.882
You found Princess Tina?

00:02:15.882 --> 00:02:19.010
Hurry, Mel!
Stop the transference device!

00:02:24.157 --> 00:02:25.192
This way!

00:02:25.192 --> 00:02:27.752
Gherta and... Flo!

00:03:05.131 --> 00:03:10.091
TO THE ZONE

00:04:08.595 --> 00:04:10.290
Helga.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:23.509
I've been dreaming of
this day for so long.

00:04:24.311 --> 00:04:27.109
But why is it so painful?

00:04:35.855 --> 00:04:37.482
Professor Gherta!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:40.927
Soreto!

00:04:40.927 --> 00:04:43.589
Mel! Hurry and stop the device!

00:04:57.477 --> 00:04:59.035
Dumas.

00:05:04.484 --> 00:05:05.585
Begin!

00:05:05.585 --> 00:05:09.248
D-Demian! Just who
are you anyway?!

00:05:11.758 --> 00:05:13.693
The pilot is on board.

00:05:13.693 --> 00:05:15.490
Stop wasting time!

00:05:18.198 --> 00:05:20.132
Hurry up and do it!

00:05:22.702 --> 00:05:24.363
That guy!

00:05:26.039 --> 00:05:27.939
From that time.

00:06:13.219 --> 00:06:17.485
Gherta, what are you doing?
Hurry up and enter your password!

00:06:25.365 --> 00:06:27.765
Enter your password!

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:31.905
Dumas.

00:06:31.905 --> 00:06:35.466
I'm not going to do what
you tell me to anymore!

00:06:36.209 --> 00:06:38.439
You said "Dumas"?

00:06:41.047 --> 00:06:43.416
You've remembered,
haven't you, Mel?

00:06:43.416 --> 00:06:44.818
Don't move!

00:06:44.818 --> 00:06:47.844
Stay right where you are! I'm a
detective from the head office!

00:06:48.121 --> 00:06:50.390
T-The head office?

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:53.393
It looks like things aren't going as you
expected, are they, Professor Gherta?

00:06:53.393 --> 00:06:55.384
Are you going to answer me?

00:06:56.096 --> 00:07:00.533
Is that giant machine something
built from the code in the Fragment?

00:07:00.867 --> 00:07:04.370
And there's no use trying to cover
up the deaths of those pilots.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:06.806
I want an explanation,
Professor Gherta.

00:07:06.806 --> 00:07:08.508
Never mind that!

00:07:08.508 --> 00:07:11.311
Contact your head office immediately!

00:07:11.311 --> 00:07:12.608
What for?

00:07:19.219 --> 00:07:23.155
I'll ask you one more time,
Mel, enter your password!

00:07:25.024 --> 00:07:27.424
I won't let you bring Tina back.

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:33.527
I won't give in to someone like you!

00:07:41.775 --> 00:07:44.835
Mel, enter your password.

00:07:45.812 --> 00:07:49.873
Dumas, I won't give in to you anymore.

00:07:53.286 --> 00:07:55.186
Stop it, Dumas!

00:07:58.458 --> 00:08:00.187
Mel!

00:08:01.461 --> 00:08:03.827
Professor! Professor Gherta!

00:08:04.998 --> 00:08:06.863
Mel!

00:08:16.209 --> 00:08:19.610
I know all of your passwords.

00:09:00.787 --> 00:09:03.517
A-Aghi! Aghi!

00:09:04.791 --> 00:09:06.359
T-Thoma...

00:09:06.359 --> 00:09:10.295
Aghi! I am Seth.

00:09:12.332 --> 00:09:16.291
I'm Seth! I'm Seth! Aghi!

00:09:16.903 --> 00:09:20.406
Seth? Lord Seth?!

00:09:20.406 --> 00:09:23.807
I killed Soran.

00:09:26.913 --> 00:09:29.983
I killed Soran!

00:09:29.983 --> 00:09:31.985
T-Thoma...

00:09:31.985 --> 00:09:34.254
Are you really Lord Seth?

00:09:34.254 --> 00:09:37.790
I... I killed Soran...

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.093
With these hands...
With these hands...

00:09:40.093 --> 00:09:44.393
How did Lord Seth get from
Greecia's Zone to here?

00:09:49.135 --> 00:09:51.194
Tina...

00:09:51.771 --> 00:09:53.602
That time...

00:09:56.109 --> 00:10:00.341
When we were transferring Princess
Tina's soul, Lord Seth was killed.

00:10:00.546 --> 00:10:04.317
He must have been pulled through the
spirit portal and came to this planet.

00:10:04.317 --> 00:10:06.319
How could such a thing...

00:10:06.319 --> 00:10:09.789
Thoma! So, then you really are...

00:10:09.789 --> 00:10:11.757
Thoma.

00:10:14.394 --> 00:10:16.055
Tina.

00:10:18.631 --> 00:10:20.496
What I did...

00:10:21.467 --> 00:10:23.594
To you...

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.335
To you...

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.674
Tina...

00:10:34.981 --> 00:10:36.449
Helga.

00:10:36.449 --> 00:10:38.351
Thoma!

00:10:38.351 --> 00:10:40.012
Helga!

00:10:45.224 --> 00:10:47.026
What is this?!

00:10:47.026 --> 00:10:48.294
It's Orsel!

00:10:48.294 --> 00:10:51.127
Oh, no! The Zone
has been opened!

00:11:19.492 --> 00:11:20.626
It's shielded!

00:11:20.626 --> 00:11:23.830
Damn! If only we could drain
the preservation fluid!

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:25.565
The transference device!

00:11:25.565 --> 00:11:27.192
Thoma!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.702
Helga! Wonder!

00:11:29.702 --> 00:11:31.533
Thoma!

00:11:33.106 --> 00:11:34.835
Get on, Chitto!

00:11:46.919 --> 00:11:48.716
Helga.

00:11:59.832 --> 00:12:01.300
She's inside that!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.291
Land here, Wonder!

00:12:06.372 --> 00:12:07.930
Look out! Thoma!

00:12:13.646 --> 00:12:15.481
-Thoma!
-Are you okay?!

00:12:15.481 --> 00:12:16.948
Helga!

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:19.252
We have to get Helga
out of the capsule!

00:12:19.252 --> 00:12:21.482
We'll have to break in,
but there's no other way!

00:12:27.527 --> 00:12:29.688
Aghi!

00:12:31.931 --> 00:12:33.330
Thoma!

00:12:46.412 --> 00:12:48.437
Wonder!

00:13:17.977 --> 00:13:19.774
The Zone is...

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.352
Princess Tina will...

00:13:26.352 --> 00:13:28.946
Princess Tina will come back to life!

00:13:39.065 --> 00:13:40.794
Dumas!

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.836
Wonder... you...

00:13:57.083 --> 00:13:58.744
Wonder.

00:14:04.891 --> 00:14:07.052
-Let's go, Chitto!
-Yeah!

00:14:09.295 --> 00:14:11.024
Run!

00:14:17.603 --> 00:14:19.332
Run faster!

00:14:40.092 --> 00:14:42.929
Dumas! There's still time!

00:14:42.929 --> 00:14:45.363
Please stop the device!

00:15:07.153 --> 00:15:09.815
Helga said it plainly!

00:15:09.989 --> 00:15:13.857
Helga wants to live her life
as Helga!

00:15:15.027 --> 00:15:18.224
No one has the right to
violate that decision!

00:15:18.698 --> 00:15:21.861
Even if you are
her younger brother!

00:15:29.075 --> 00:15:33.012
Helga's...
Helga's life is ending!

00:15:33.012 --> 00:15:35.181
Helga will die!

00:15:35.181 --> 00:15:36.816
I beg of you, Dumas!

00:15:36.816 --> 00:15:38.684
Save Helga!

00:15:38.684 --> 00:15:41.619
Don't kill Helga, Dumas!

00:15:42.355 --> 00:15:44.118
Dumas!

00:15:52.198 --> 00:15:54.666
Damn! The discharge won't stop!

00:15:56.369 --> 00:15:57.961
Chitto!

00:16:08.414 --> 00:16:10.780
Wonder!

00:16:18.391 --> 00:16:22.228
Wonder! Wonder! Wonder!

00:16:22.228 --> 00:16:23.991
Wonder!

00:16:24.196 --> 00:16:26.630
Wonder...

00:16:27.033 --> 00:16:29.092
Wonder...

00:16:32.705 --> 00:16:36.937
I beg of you, Dumas.
Don't kill Helga.

00:16:50.923 --> 00:16:52.458
Dumas.

00:16:52.458 --> 00:16:55.450
My little brother, Dumas.

00:16:56.028 --> 00:16:58.997
I believe in you!

00:17:00.866 --> 00:17:02.800
Dumas!

00:17:05.438 --> 00:17:07.099
Helga!

00:17:21.721 --> 00:17:23.322
The light...

00:17:23.322 --> 00:17:25.290
The Zone is closed.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:36.831
Dumas.

00:17:45.578 --> 00:17:47.341
Helga.

00:17:50.516 --> 00:17:53.246
H-Her heart has...
Big Sister!

00:17:56.188 --> 00:17:57.356
Dumas!

00:17:57.356 --> 00:18:01.315
The transfer of Tina's soul
has not been completed.

00:18:01.594 --> 00:18:03.858
Why did you stop the device?

00:18:10.202 --> 00:18:15.367
Restart it immediately and bring
Tina back to life quickly!

00:18:18.511 --> 00:18:21.347
What's wrong, Dumas?!

00:18:21.347 --> 00:18:23.872
Can't you hear my voice?!

00:18:42.368 --> 00:18:46.964
H-Have you lost your mind?
Dumas!

00:18:49.041 --> 00:18:52.943
I have never even once
thought of you as my father.

00:18:54.013 --> 00:18:56.573
W-What?!

00:18:57.349 --> 00:19:00.341
You killed Mother!

00:19:00.953 --> 00:19:03.285
My second revenge!

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:18.730
Dumas.

00:19:27.746 --> 00:19:29.615
-Helga!
-Helga!

00:19:29.615 --> 00:19:31.310
Helga!

00:19:33.419 --> 00:19:35.387
Helga!

00:19:36.856 --> 00:19:38.991
Is Helga dead?

00:19:38.991 --> 00:19:40.960
No, she's in a coma.

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:43.362
She hasn't entered the Zone yet.

00:19:43.362 --> 00:19:46.732
The Interval!
Helga is in the Interval!

00:19:46.732 --> 00:19:48.234
Interval?

00:19:48.234 --> 00:19:51.670
It's the dimension between
the physical world and the Zone!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:54.298
At any rate, we have to get her
to an infirmary quickly!

00:19:59.178 --> 00:20:00.279
Dumas!

00:20:00.279 --> 00:20:02.181
-You!
-Wait!

00:20:02.181 --> 00:20:04.149
Dumas stopped the device!

00:20:04.617 --> 00:20:05.951
Big Sister!

00:20:05.951 --> 00:20:08.852
Big Sister!
H-How can we save her?!

00:20:09.388 --> 00:20:12.825
The only chance is for someone to go
into the Interval and bring her back!

00:20:12.825 --> 00:20:15.225
Aghi! I'll go!

00:20:15.828 --> 00:20:18.661
She is my big sister!
I will go!

00:20:18.964 --> 00:20:22.034
You won't be able to save her!

00:20:22.034 --> 00:20:24.069
She's my big sister.

00:20:24.069 --> 00:20:27.732
I will definitely save her!
I will not let her die!

00:20:59.138 --> 00:21:00.973
Listen, Thoma.

00:21:00.973 --> 00:21:03.242
We'll use the transference device
to send you into the Interval.

00:21:03.242 --> 00:21:05.811
You absolutely must not
go near the Zone!

00:21:05.811 --> 00:21:10.115
If you enter the Zone, you won't
be able to come back here again!

00:21:10.115 --> 00:21:12.583
I'll die, right?

00:21:12.885 --> 00:21:15.621
Thoma! In order to come back here,

00:21:15.621 --> 00:21:18.357
you have to focus on your will to live!

00:21:18.357 --> 00:21:20.559
Focus your thoughts on life!

00:21:20.559 --> 00:21:23.262
If you do that, you'll definitely
be able to come back!

00:21:23.262 --> 00:21:25.730
Do you understand, Thoma?

00:21:28.834 --> 00:21:31.302
Aghi! We need the passwords!

00:21:32.905 --> 00:21:34.532
Dumas.

00:22:35.601 --> 00:22:45.408
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.678 --> 00:22:55.521
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.521 --> 00:23:00.254
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.292 --> 00:23:05.127
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.531 --> 00:23:14.667
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.773 --> 00:23:19.812
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:19.812 --> 00:23:25.117
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.117 --> 00:23:29.521
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.521 --> 00:23:33.859
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:33.859 --> 00:23:38.728
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
